</head>
<body>
  <div class="ambient ambient-one" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="ambient ambient-two" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="page-grid" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <header class="topbar">
    <a class="brand" href="index.html" aria-label="Back to Hieu portfolio"><span class="brand-mark">HC<span>.</span></span><span class="brand-label">hieu-commits<span> / portfolio</span></span></a>
    <nav class="nav" aria-label="Project navigation"><a href="index.html#expertise">Expertise</a><a href="index.html#work">Project blueprints</a><a class="nav-cta" href="https://github.com/hieu-commits" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub ↗</a></nav>
  </header>
  <main id="top">
    <!-- Duplicate this file for a real project, then replace every bracketed placeholder. -->
    <section class="section-wrap project-detail-hero">
      <span class="section-index">PROJECT DETAIL / [NUMBER] · [DOMAIN]</span>
      <h1>[Project name] <span class="gradient-text">[short outcome]</span></h1>
      <p class="hero-lead">[Explain the problem this project solves, who it helps, and what you built. Keep this factual and concise.]</p>
      <div class="hero-actions"><a class="button button-primary" href="[REPOSITORY_URL]" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">View source code ↗</a><a class="button button-ghost" href="index.html#work">Back to portfolio ↗</a></div>
    </section>
    <section class="section-wrap section-block">
      <div class="project-detail-grid">
        <article class="panel project-detail-panel">
          <div class="panel-label"><span class="panel-icon icon-cyan">⌘</span><span>ENGINEERING NOTES</span></div>
          <h2>Problem & approach</h2>
          <p>[Describe the requirement, constraints, architecture, and why the main technical choices were made.]</p>
          <h2>Implementation</h2>
          <p>[Explain the key modules, data flow, configuration, or algorithms. Link to relevant source files if useful.]</p>
          <h2>Validation & results</h2>
          <p>[Add test commands, screenshots, metrics, packet captures, benchmark results, or other reproducible evidence. Do not invent results.]</p>
          <h2>Limitations & next steps</h2>
          <p>[State what is incomplete, what you learned, and what you would improve next.]</p>
        </article>
        <aside class="panel project-detail-panel">
          <div class="panel-label"><span class="panel-icon icon-violet">◈</span><span>PROJECT DETAILS</span></div>
          <dl class="project-meta-list">
            <div><dt>Status</dt><dd>[Prototype / In progress / Complete]</dd></div>
            <div><dt>Role</dt><dd>[Your role]</dd></div>
            <div><dt>Stack</dt><dd>[Languages and tools actually used]</dd></div>
            <div><dt>Environment</dt><dd>[OS, runtime, lab, cloud or test setup]</dd></div>
            <div><dt>License</dt><dd>[License or not specified]</dd></div>
          </dl>
        </aside>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
  <footer class="footer section-wrap"><a class="brand footer-brand" href="index.html"><span class="brand-mark">HC<span>.</span></span><span class="brand-label">hieu-commits<span> / portfolio</span></span></a><p>Learn deeply. Build deliberately. Verify everything.</p><div class="footer-right"><span>© <span id="year">2026</span> Hieu</span><a href="#top">Back to top ↑</a></div></footer>
